                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo, mubuzuba bwakumi mwaatatu wamwezi mutaanzi, balembi bamwami bakaitwa, lugwalo lwakabambwa mbuli mbwaakalailila Hamani, lwakubeendelezi bamwami, kubami bazisi, akulibasimutwe bamikowa yoonse kalulembedwe cisi coonse mubulembo bwaco amukowa woonse mululimi lwawo; lwakalembwa muzina lyamwami Ahasuera akusimbwa alusimbo lwamwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
